# Clinexa AI

## Intelligent Healthcare Assistant

Clinexa AI is an AI-powered healthcare assistant designed to help clinics automate patient interactions, appointment scheduling, document understanding, and healthcare workflows.

## Vision

To build an intelligent AI assistant that improves patient experience and clinic productivity using Generative AI.

## Tech Stack

### Backend


- Python
- FastAPI
- MongoDB

### Frontend

- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS

### AI

- Ollama
- LangChain
- FAISS

## Current Status

🚧 Project Initialization